{"4353330": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Rinthine", "steam_appid": 4353330, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rinthine</strong> is a survival-crafting adventure set within the Machine—a labyrinth of winding paths, crumbling ruins, and buried secrets. Step into the role of the Wayfinder as you explore the endless halls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4353330/extras/e09c06170f4540129c266538f6021ccc.poster.avif?t=1787352493\" width=1080 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4353330/extras/e09c06170f4540129c266538f6021ccc.webm?t=1787352493\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4353330/extras/e09c06170f4540129c266538f6021ccc.mp4?t=1787352493\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A LIVING LITHOGRAPH</strong> Explore a living illustration that blends a 2D hand-drawn aesthetic with a fully traversable 3D environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SURVIVE THE MACHINE</strong> Scour the rooms for useful resources to fashion tools and build a base. Ration food, prepare for battle, and keep your maps close, for calamity walks the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4353330/extras/0514c34a00c2a0fc30793c967c08aa3e.poster.avif?t=1787352493\" width=1080 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4353330/extras/0514c34a00c2a0fc30793c967c08aa3e.webm?t=1787352493\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4353330/extras/0514c34a00c2a0fc30793c967c08aa3e.mp4?t=1787352493\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RELIC-TECH NIGHTMARES</strong> Navigate encounters with dangerous entities born from mythology and unknown technologies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A VOLATILE WORLD</strong> Seasons come and go. From the cold marble of classical architecture to the overgrown courtyards of abandoned palaces, rooms within the labyrinth never stay the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive the night.</strong> <strong>Uncover the mystery. Master the halls.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4353330/extras/3a4d9575604abf690f762c800797dbef.poster.avif?t=1787352493\" width=1080 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4353330/extras/3a4d9575604abf690f762c800797dbef.webm?t=1787352493\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4353330/extras/3a4d9575604abf690f762c800797dbef.mp4?t=1787352493\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An infinite mix of <strong>handcrafted </strong>and <strong>procedurally-generated</strong> rooms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seasons </strong>that change the<strong> environment, enemies, and introduce new mechanics</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online Co-op<br><br></strong>”Th